{"code":"023350","name":"한국종합기술","market":"KOSPI","sector_name":"건설","sector_desc":"주택·토목·플랜트 시공. 부동산 경기, 금리, 해외 수주와 원가율이 핵심 변수입니다.","desc":"동사는 1963년 경제개발계획과 관련된 대규모 종합엔지니어링 회사로 설립되었으며, 연료전지 발전사업을 하는 명지2호에너지와 양주용암에너지를 보유하고 있음. 상하수도, 수자원개발, 도시계획, 교통, 철도 등 전 분야에서 설계, 감리, 자문을 수행하는 종합건설엔지니어링 회사임. 신재생에너지 사업영역 확대 위한 기술 상용화 투자를 강화하며, 환경·플랜트 EPC사업 진출 추진하고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-16","n_days":300,"close":3705.0,"open":3745.0,"high":3760.0,"low":3660.0,"volume":76469,"amount":283317645.0,"ret_1d":1.5068,"gap":2.6027,"range_pct":2.6991,"ret_5":1.5068,"ret_20":-7.8358,"ret_60":-11.1511,"ret_120":-31.5157,"ret_250":-21.9178,"ma20":3839.0,"ma60":3944.8333,"ma120":4317.25,"ma200":4464.3,"close_vs_ma200":-17.0083,"close_vs_ma60":-6.0797,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":-20.1409,"r2_60":0.1823,"slope_120":-50.8976,"r2_120":0.8079,"slope_250":-18.5127,"r2_250":0.4121,"high52":6240.0,"low52":3335.0,"pos_52w":12.7367,"dd_52w":-40.625,"mdd_1y":-33.2724,"atr14_pct":6.9308,"vol_ann_60":34.4932,"vol_avg20":102331.95,"vol_ratio20":0.7473,"vr5":17.4111,"vr20":1.6681,"amount_avg5":1331380112.0,"amount_avg20":387135086.75,"amount_avg60":186910954.25,"obv_chg20":50.507,"turnover_20":18.6908,"pv_eff_20":-0.4192,"rsi14":41.2542,"frgn_net_5":11062.0,"inst_net_5":-10858.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":0.101,"inst_net_5_pct":-0.0992,"smart_net_5_pct":0.0019,"frgn_net_20":-75151.0,"inst_net_20":-11059.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":-0.6863,"inst_net_20_pct":-0.101,"smart_net_20_pct":-0.7873,"frgn_net_60":-180688.0,"inst_net_60":-10111.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":-1.6501,"inst_net_60_pct":-0.0923,"smart_net_60_pct":-1.7425,"frgn_net_120":-194103.0,"inst_net_120":12209.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":-1.7726,"inst_net_120_pct":0.1115,"smart_net_120_pct":-1.6611,"foreign_ratio":2.34,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":-1.49,"smart_buy_streak":0,"op_income_q":4.0,"op_margin_q":0.4016,"op_qoq":-90.0,"op_turnaround":0.0,"op_yoy":-87.0968,"rev_yoy":-2.1611,"op_trend_4q":-10.6122,"fin_period":"202606","roe":8.06,"debt_ratio":153.72,"per":3.03,"pbr